hadiths[21]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1463","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aik din Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gaya, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bukhar tha. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ko to sakht bukhar aata hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mujhe itna bukhar aata hai jitna tum mein se do aadmiyon ko aaye. Main ne kaha ke kya ye is liye hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye dohra ajar hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Haan. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke koi Musalman aisa nahi jis ko beemari ya kuch aur takleef pahunchi, magar ye ke Allah Taala us ke gunah aisay gira deta hai jaisay darakht, sookhay, pattay gira deta hai. (Muslim). (Waak se murad bukhar hai.)"
"1464","[AI-translation] Sauban (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beemaar ki iyadat, us ke makaan par ja kar, karnay wala jannat ke aik baagh mein hai, yahan tak ke wo wapas lautay. (Muslim: 8/13). (Khurfa se murad baagh ka phal hai.)"
"1465","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala qayamat ke din farmaye ga ke Ae Adam ke betay! Main beemaar hua tu ne meri khabar na li. Wo kahay ga ke Ae mere Rab! Main teri khabar kaisay leta? Tu to saaray jahan ka Maalik hai? Allah Taala farmaye ga ke tujhe maloom nahi hai ke mera falan banda beemaar hua tha, tu ne us ki khabar na li? Agar tu us ki khabar leta to tu mujhe us ke nazdeek pata. Ae Adam ke betay! Main ne tujh se khana maanga, tu ne mujhe khana na diya. Wo kahay ga ke Ae Rab! Main tujhe kaisay khilata? Tu saaray jahan ka Maalik hai? Allah Taala farmaye ga ke kya tu nahi janta ke mere falan banday ne tujh se khana maanga tu ne us ko na khilaya? Agar tu us ko khilata to us ka sawab mere paas pata. Ae Adam ke betay main ne tujh se pani maanga, lekin tu ne mujh ko pani na pilaya. Banda bolay ga ke main tujhe kaisay pilata tu to saaray jahan ka Maalik hai? Allah Taala farmaye ga ke mere falan banday ne tujh se pani maanga, tu ne us ko nahi pilaya. Agar us ko pilata to us ka badla mere paas pata. (Muslim: 8/13). Baab: Koi na kahay ke mera nafs khabees ho gaya."
"1466","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi na kahay ke mera nafs khabees ho gaya, yani napaak aur najis, balke yun kahay ke mera nafs kaahil aur sust ho gaya. Khabees aur napaak kafir ka laqab hai aur is liye Musalman ko ye lafz apne liye bolnay se mana kiya gaya aur aik hadees mein aaya ke phir subah ko khabees-un-nafs uthta hai to wo ghair ki sifat hai aur shakhs-e-mubham ka bayan hai, aisa itlaaq mana nahi. (Muslim: 7/47). (Khubus se murad susti hai.)"
"1467","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har beemari ki dawa hai, jab wo dawa beemari par pahunchti hai, to Allah Taala ke hukm se shifa ho jati hai. (Muslim: 7/21). Baab: Bukhar jahannam ki bhaap se hai to usay pani se thanda karo."
"1468","[AI-translation] Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke jab un ke paas koi bukhar wali aurat laayi jati, to wo pani mangwatin aur us ke girebaan mein daaltin aur kehtin ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us, bukhar, ko pani se thanda karo aur farmaya ke bukhar jahannam ki bhaap se hota hai. (Muslim: 7/23-24). Baab: Bukhar gunaah mita deta hai."
"1469","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Umm Saib, ya Umm Musayyab, (raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaye, to farmaya ke Ae Umm Saib, ya Umm Musayyab! Tu larz rahi hai tujhe kya hua? Wo bolein ke bukhar hai, Allah Taala us ko barkat na de. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke bukhar ko bura mat keh, kyunke wo aadmiyon ke gunaahon ko aisay door kar deta hai jaisay bhatti lohay ke mail ko door kar deti hai. (Muslim: 8/16). Baab: Mirgi aur us ka sawab. (Tuzazfifeen se murad sakht harkat hai.)"
"1470","[AI-translation] Ataa bin Abu Rabah kehtay hain ke Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne mujh se kaha ke kya main tujhe aik jannati aurat dikhaun? Main ne kaha dikhlao. Unhon ne kaha ke ye kaali aurat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur boli ke mujhe mirgi ki beemari hai, us haalat mein mera badan khul jata hai, Allah Taala se mere liye dua kijiye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agar tu sabr karay to tere liye jannat ho gi aur agar tu kahay to main dua karta hun, Allah Taala tujhe tandrust kar de ga. Wo boli ke main sabr karun gi. Phir boli ke mera badan khul jata hai, Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke mera badan na khulay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us aurat ke liye dua ki, chunanche us ka badan us haalat mein hargiz na khulta tha. Maloom hua ke beemari aur museebat mein sabr karnay ka badla jannat hai. (Muslim: 8/16). Baab: Talbeena beemaar ke dil ko khush karta hai."
"1471","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke jab un ke ghar mein koi faut ho jata to aurtein jama hotin, phir jab chali jatin aur un ke ghar mein sirf ghar walay aur khaas log reh jatay, to wo talbeena ki aik haandi ka hukm kartin, talbeena bhoosi ya aatay mein shehed mila kar hareera tayyar kiya jata hai, phir wo pakta. Us ke baad sareed, roti aur shorba, tayyar hota aur talbeena ko us par daal detein, phir wo auraton se kehtin ke us ko khao, kyunke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke talbeena beemaar ke dil ko khush karta hai aur us ke peenay se ranj kuch ghat, kam, jata hai. (Muslim: 7/26)"
"1472","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke mere bhai ko dast aa rahay hain, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ko shehed pila de. Us ne shehed pila diya. Phir aaya aur kehnay laga ke shehed pilanay se dast aur zyada ho gaye hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne teen martaba yehi farmaya ke shehed pila de. Phir chauthi baar wo aaya aur kehnay laga ke main ne shehed pilaya, lekin dast zyada ho gaye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala sacha hai aur tere bhai ka pait jhoota hai. Phir us ne shehed pilaya to wo theek ho gaya. (Muslim: 7/26). Baab: Kalonji se ilaaj."
"1473","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye farmatay hue suna, kaalay daanay mein siwae saam ke har beemari ki shifa hai. Aur saam maut ko kehtay hain aur kaalay daanay se murad kalonji hai. (Muslim: 7/25). Baab: Jo subah saat ajwa khajoor khaye usay zehar ya jadu nuqsan na de ga."
"1474","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke jo shakhs subah ke waqt saat ajwa khajoorein kha le to us ko shaam tak koi zehar nuqsan na karay ga aur na koi jadu us par asar karay ga. (Muslim: 6/123)"
"1475","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aaliya, wo hissa Madina ka jo Najd ki taraf hai, ki ajwa mein shifa hai ya farmaya ke wo subah ke waqt tiryaaq hai. Tiryaaq ka sa faida rakhti hai. (Muslim: 6/124). Baab: Khumbhi mann mein se hai aur us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai."
"1476","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke khumbhi us mann mein se hai jis ko Allah Taala ne Bani Israeel par utara tha aur us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai. (Muslim: 6/124). Baab: Ood-e-Hindi yani kust se ilaaj."
"1477","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Mas'ud se riwayat hai ke Umm Qais bint Mihsan (raziyallahu anha), jo ke muhajiraat ki pehli auraton mein se thin aur unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se baiat ki thi aur wo Ukasha bin Mihsan ki behan thin jo ke Bani Asad bin Khuzaima mein se thay, ne mujhe khabar di, kaha ke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas apna bacha le kar aayi jo abhi khana khanay ki umar ko nahi pahuncha tha. Aur uzra ki beemari ki wajah se unhon, Umm Qais, ne us ka halaq dabaya tha, Yunus ne kaha ke alaqat ba-maani ghamzat hai. Wo bachay par tashannuj ke khatra se darti thin. Wo kehti hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum apni aulad ko taalu dabanay aur charhanay se, ungli ya lakri ki gherni se, takleef kyun deti ho? Tum ood-e-Hindi yani kust ko lazim pakro. Us mein saat beemariyon ka ilaaj hai, aik un mein se zaat-ul-janb, pasli ka dard, bhi hai. Ubaidullah ne kaha ke Umm Qais (raziyallahu anha) ne mujh se bayan kiya ke un ke usi bachay ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki god mein peshaab kar diya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne pani mangwaya aur apne kapray par chhirak diya aur us ko dhoya nahi. (Muslim). (Daghr se murad dabana hai; ladood munh mein dawa hai.)"
"1478","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki beemari mein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke munh mein dawa daali to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ishara se farmaya ke mere munh mein dawa mat daalo. Ham logon ne aapas mein kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) beemari ki wajah se dawa se nafrat kartay hain, to us par amal karna zaroori nahi. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko hosh aaya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum sab ke munh mein dawa daali jaye siwae Abbas (raziyallahu anhu) ke ke wo yahan maujood na thay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un logon ko ye saza di jinhon ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka hukm na maana. (Muslim: 7/24). Baab: Pachhna lagwana aur naak mein dawa daalna."
"1479","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne pachhnay lagwaye aur pachhnay laganay walay ko mazdoori di aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne naak mein bhi dawa daali. (Muslim: 7/22). Baab: Pachhna aur daagh se ilaaj."
"1480","[AI-translation] Aasim bin Umar bin Qatada kehtay hain ke Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) hamaray ghar mein aaye aur aik shakhs ko zakhm ki takleef thi, yani qarha par gaya tha. Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tujhe kya takleef hai? Wo bola ke aik qarha ho gaya hai jo ke mujh par nihayat sakht hai. Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae ghulam! Aik pachhnay laganay walay ko le kar aa. Wo bola ke pachhnay laganay walay ka kya kaam hai? Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main us zakhm par pachhnay lagwana chahta hun, wo bola ke Allah ki qasam mujhe makhiyan satayein gi aur kapra lagay ga to mujhe takleef ho gi aur mujh par bohat sakht, waqt, guzray ga. Jab Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne dekha ke us ko pachhnay laganay se ranj hota hai to kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke agar tumhari dawaon mein behtar koi dawa hai to teen hi dawayein hain, aik to pachhna, doosray shehed ka aik ghont aur teesray angaray se jalana aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main daagh lena behtar nahi janta. Rawi ne kaha ke phir pachhnay laganay wala aaya aur us ne us ko pachhnay lagaye aur us ki beemari jati rahi. (Muslim)"
"1481","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se pachhnay lagwanay ki ijazat chahi, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Taiba ko un ke pachhnay laganay ka hukm diya. Rawi ne kaha ke main gumaan karta hun ke unhon ne kaha ke Abu Taiba Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) ke razai bhai thay ya nabaligh larkay thay, jin se parda zaroori nahi aur zaroorat ke waqt dawa ke liye agar aurat ya larka na milay to ajnabi shakhs bhi laga sakta hai. (Muslim: 7/22)"
"1482","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas hakeem ko bheja, us ne aik rag kaati, yani fasd li, phir us par daagh diya. (Muslim: 7/22). Baab: Zakham ke ilaaj ke liye daaghna."
"1483","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd bin Muaz (raziyallahu anhu) ko akhal, aik rag hai, mein teer laga, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko apne haath se teer ke phal se daagh diya, un ke haath par sozish ho gayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dobara daagh diya. (Muslim: 7/22). (Hasama se murad khoon rokna hai; mishqas teer ka phal hai.)"
